</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/9b376fb4-4b6c-11eb-a888-005056a964fe/w:1024/p:16x9/tau_06.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/9b376fb4-4b6c-11eb-a888-005056a964fe/w:1024/p:16x9/tau_06.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">44267056-80f6-11f1-aea8-05c808138351</guid><pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 09:44:33 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/9b376fb4-4b6c-11eb-a888-005056a964fe/w:1024/p:16x9/tau_06.jpg">© 路透社图片</source><dc:creator>弗林</dc:creator></item><item><category>政治</category><title>特朗普据报将在周四晚演讲中谈及中国涉嫌干预美国选举事宜</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB/20260716-%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E6%8D%AE%E6%8A%A5%E5%B0%86%E5%9C%A8%E5%91%A8%E5%9B%9B%E6%99%9A%E6%BC%94%E8%AE%B2%E4%B8%AD%E8%B0%88%E5%8F%8A%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%B6%89%E5%AB%8C%E5%B9%B2%E9%A2%84%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E9%80%89%E4%B8%BE%E4%BA%8B%E5%AE%9C</link><description>
